    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u04/listening-01.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u04/listening-01.wav",
      "script": "ねこは、つくえのしたにいます。ほんは、いすのうえにあります。",
      "sha256": "5ef8e7481fb0c69d7b4ede3d4a97ab8237e6e6fde4633dbe181e52049e27cc3a",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u04/listening-02.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u04/listening-02.wav",
      "script": "いぬは、にわにいます。ともだちは、へやのなかにいます。いぬは、へやにはいません。",
      "sha256": "26e2d8f12f5dc1c320f0e0252b59636fbd133f5d3e68ffc7084aa64a23a32bbf",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u04/listening-03.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u04/listening-03.wav",
      "script": "みせは、えきのとなりにあります。こうえんは、みせのうしろにあります。せんせいは、こうえんにいます。",
      "sha256": "54451a050c81355aa58aff8caac92f63ccfe29b7ca190048729b70b0de90f5bc",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u04/listening-04.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u04/listening-04.wav",
      "script": "ねこは、つくえのしたにいます。いぬは、ドアのまえにいます。ほんは、つくえのうえにあります。かばんは、はこのなかにあります。",
      "sha256": "68707babaede8502155b9dbb3e6a2f37cace052f441b2cb5f759ae6c6bee85d6",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u04/listening-05.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u04/listening-05.wav",
      "script": "ねこは、どこにいますか。",
      "sha256": "5e65bd3b94e5e91505a4c019eb5f554a7704b81e0acf4eb6885046bb6fb03084",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u04/listening-06.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u04/listening-06.wav",
      "script": "はこのなかに、なにがありますか。",
      "sha256": "cda8041874e576de16a78be024964a1f30ac6fa69bbb4bfedbd13c80238ee493",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u04/U04-teach-words-1.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u04/U04-teach-words-1.wav",
      "script": "うえ。した。なか。そと。まえ。",
      "sha256": "30345e9cd1d3b59b37bf71a84b745ee2841a119809e4a049ac8c3a97829da165",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u04/U04-teach-words-2.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u04/U04-teach-words-2.wav",
      "script": "うしろ。みぎ。ひだり。となり。ちかく。",
      "sha256": "67ae5a92577549fc598d3f3b1369b9e74181a2cc7cb94d187f2f7bdfc7d51f7d",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u04/U04-teach-words-3.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u04/U04-teach-words-3.wav",
      "script": "あいだ。ここ。そこ。あそこ。どこ。",
      "sha256": "379f8f304027d22b1ef3c4cac920a0202e76893dcff092f20771acc83165272c",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u04/U04-teach-words-4.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u04/U04-teach-words-4.wav",
      "script": "へや。にわ。こうえん。えき。みせ。",
      "sha256": "6a529026d7c0b4fdbbb5eed6fcb22353829e87a7b6955a62c5eefce82f641be9",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u04/U04-teach-words-5.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u04/U04-teach-words-5.wav",
      "script": "トイレ。ベッド。テレビ。あります。います。",
      "sha256": "9794feeb71f5264edec39fdf2c21adccc63533ee3501a99a3d359cbe9e857bea",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u04/U04-teach-kanji.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u04/U04-teach-kanji.wav",
      "script": "うえ。した。なか。そと。まえ。つくえのうえ。はこのなか。",
      "sha256": "77b2ff6e9411035b6c1c18ececa45c0fbb8e9db6fb62a3d04e6c1b8811b578b7",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u04/U04-teach-G10.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u04/U04-teach-G10.wav",
      "script": "ねこがいます。いぬがいます。せんせいがいます。ほんがあります。かばんがあります。ねこはいません。ほんはありません。",
      "sha256": "3b783934e6bf9e10336322b1fc5020687580682a73a102bc4916c23863c6ee59",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
